{"id":"n37397-1-8","stage":5,"title":"권총 · 手枪","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37397-1-8-1","ko":"어제 새벽에 우리 동네에서 총기 사건이 발생했대.","zh":"听说昨天凌晨我们小区发生了枪击事件。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새벽에","meaning":"凌晨，早晨","explanation":"새벽：凌晨，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62740","senseId":"2","lemma":"새벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동네에서","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"총기","meaning":"枪支","explanation":"총기：枪支","readings":[{"term":"총기","audio":"/audio/d01833e314fce277487e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80460","senseId":"1","lemma":"총기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사건이","meaning":"事件，案件","explanation":"사건：事件，案件；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사건","audio":"/audio/d04be92d4a8150be63c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15654","senseId":"1","lemma":"사건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발생했대.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"발생하다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"발생하다","audio":"/audio/f0cb725225430247cd36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66250","senseId":"1","lemma":"발생하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/7